["<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">撮影</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さつえい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">摄影；拍摄；摄制；录像</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"221461\">この<ruby>写真<rp>(</rp><rt>しゃしん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>によって<ruby>撮影<rp>(</rp><rt>さつえい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>された。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这张照片是由他拍的。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">殺人</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さつじん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">谋杀；杀人；过失杀人</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"106724\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>殺人<rp>(</rp><rt>さつじん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>以外<rp>(</rp><rt>いがい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のことなら<ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>でもするだろう。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他会做任何事情,除了谋杀。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">さて</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">接续词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">接続詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">好吧；那么；现在</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">砂糖</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さとう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">糖；砂糖</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"196232\">ポットにはあまり<ruby>砂糖<rp>(</rp><rt>さとう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がなかった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">波特没有太多的糖。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">悟る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さとる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">感知；察觉；认识；领悟；理解；明白；认识；领会；开悟；得道；证悟</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"202654\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はついに<ruby>自分<rp>(</rp><rt>じぶん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>誤<rp>(</rp><rt>あやま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りを<ruby>悟<rp>(</rp><rt>さと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>った。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他终于醒觉到自己做错了。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/338998\" title=\"Tatoeba · nickyeow\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · nickyeow\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">砂漠</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さばく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">沙漠</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"192650\">ラクダは、いわば<ruby>砂漠<rp>(</rp><rt>さばく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>船<rp>(</rp><rt>ふね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">骆驼，这么说吧，也就是沙漠中的船。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/512804\" title=\"Tatoeba · fucongcong\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · fucongcong\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">裁く</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さばく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">进行裁决；做出判决；审判；判断</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"137033\"><ruby>誰<rp>(</rp><rt>だれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がこの<ruby>事件<rp>(</rp><rt>じけん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>裁<rp>(</rp><rt>さば</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くのでしょうか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">谁会审判这个案件?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">錆</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さび</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">锈；锈蚀</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"221395\">この<ruby>車<rp>(</rp><rt>くるま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>錆<rp>(</rp><rt>さび</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>強<rp>(</rp><rt>つよ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这辆车非常强大。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">寂しい</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さびしい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">孤独；寂寞；冷清；荒凉</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"205781\">それで、<ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はとてもさびしく<ruby>思<rp>(</rp><rt>おも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っています。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">因此,她觉得很冷静。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">錆びる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さびる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">生锈；变得生锈</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"189574\"><ruby>雨<rp>(</rp><rt>あめ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>中<rp>(</rp><rt>なか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>放置<rp>(</rp><rt>ほうち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しておくと<ruby>自転車<rp>(</rp><rt>じてんしゃ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はさびるでしょう。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">把它放在雨中,自行车会倒下。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">差別</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さべつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">区别；区分；差别；歧视；不公正对待</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"144387\"><ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>人種<rp>(</rp><rt>じんしゅ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>差別<rp>(</rp><rt>さべつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>するのは<ruby>間違<rp>(</rp><rt>まちが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">种族歧视是错误的。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">作法</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さほう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">礼仪；礼节；规范；创作方式；写作手法（尤指散文、诗歌等）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"106822\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>作法<rp>(</rp><rt>さほう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がぎこちない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他没有做法。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">さほど</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">（不）太；（不）很；（不）那么；（没）那么</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">サボる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">逃课；旷课；偷懒；早退</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"98198\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らはいつも<ruby>学校<rp>(</rp><rt>がっこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をサボっています。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他们总是放弃学校。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">様</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さま</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"v-m\">先生；太太；小姐；女士；使词语更加礼貌（常用于固定表达）；状态；情形；外观；样子</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"76459\">フラフラと<ruby>歩<rp>(</rp><rt>ある</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>き<ruby>回<rp>(</rp><rt>まわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>る<ruby>様<rp>(</rp><rt>さま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は、あまりにデンジャラスだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">和弗拉夫拉一起走路是太丹杰拉斯了。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">様々</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さまざま</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">各种各样；五花八门；形形色色</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"160657\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はさまざまな<ruby>困難<rp>(</rp><rt>こんなん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>経験<rp>(</rp><rt>けいけん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我经历了各种各样的困难。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">冷ます</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さます</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">冷却；使冷却；冷却到室温；泼冷水；扫兴；破坏气氛</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"202706\">ちょっと<ruby>冷<rp>(</rp><rt>さ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まして、<ruby>熱<rp>(</rp><rt>あつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いうちは<ruby>食<rp>(</rp><rt>た</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>べないように。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">冷一点,不要在热的时候吃。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">覚ます</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さます</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">唤醒；使从睡眠中醒来；使清醒；纠正（某人的）错误认识；使酒醒；使醒酒；泼冷水；扫兴；破坏气氛</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"206912\">その<ruby>物音<rp>(</rp><rt>ものおと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>眠<rp>(</rp><rt>ねむ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りから<ruby>覚<rp>(</rp><rt>さ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まさせた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">那声音让我从睡眠中醒来。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">妨げる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">さまたげる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">妨碍；阻止；阻挡；妨害</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"209982\">その<ruby>事件<rp>(<